        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I had a thought earlier today and wanted to share: I'm [i]really[/i] glad Sentinels of the Multiverse is not a collectable card game. I think allowing us to enjoy the universe, creating interesting and impactful flavor while providing enough mechanics and capabilities to ensure many unique and enjoyable games was a much better way to go. \n\nIt would have been easy to make the leap to a CCG as another money-making opportunity, but the fact that the game can be expanded just by expanding the multiverse will hopefully help keep you in business. \n\nAnd maybe one day we'll even see actual comics.  8)\n\nMany thanks!  :D\n\nRabit",
