        "user_title": "Chief Justice",
        "title_is_group": false,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "We think that's one of the best features too!  All of us at Greater Than Games have played various CCGs, but we all stopped playing them after the cost became unsustainable.  When making the game, our primary goal was to create a game that we really wanted to play.  Thus, no CCGs (because we're cheap), and a cooperative game where no one has to run the villain (because we always get roped into being the GM :) )",
